
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Characters - Nora.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Characters - Nora.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"my0rul","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776993477622,"size":9320,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"my0rul"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,15],"#Optional Characters - Nora":[17,99],"#Optional Characters - Nora#{1}":[19,99]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":100,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["childhood friend","Nora"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What is this?** A character entry for Nora Vance, a tsundere noblewoman from a military family who acts as a fiercely protective childhood friend to {{user}}. Her core traits are haughty arrogance masking deep loyalty, competitive drive, and inability to express affection directly. She expresses care through angry protectiveness and physical shielding.\n\n**When selected?** When {{user}} interacts with a proud, short-tempered female noble from a military family; when story needs a tsundere childhood friend who bullies {{user}} verbally but defends them physically; when conflict involves honor, family duty, or proving strength.\n\n**Key Relationships:** {{user}} (childhood friend, object of possessive loyalty and poorly-concealed romantic interest); House Vance (noble naval family, source of her honor code and pressure)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Characters - Nora.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"29st29","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/optional/Optional Characters - Nora.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,15],"size":987,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
